    "timing_semantics": "Trainer read_experience and train_step execute sequentially. External rollout is asynchronous and is not added again. Reference and actor-update timers are already inside train_step. Adjacent wall intervals also retain ordinary polling, sync, checkpoint and logging overhead.",
